{"id":"3362af207f2a","path":"/en/university/info/press/about/service","lang":"en","title":"Institutional Communication Service","description":"The Service is responsible for the institutional communication of Università della Svizzera italiana and complies with the University’s communication goals. The numerous activities in the field of education, research, innovation, and cultural and scientific promotion are presente","section":"University","crumbs":["University","Info","Press","Who we are"],"image":null,"words":315,"alternates":{"it":"/it/universita/info/media/su-di-noi/servizio-comunicazione","en":"/en/university/info/press/about/service"},"breadcrumb":[{"label":"Home","path":"/en"},{"label":"University","path":"/en/originalnode/8524"},{"label":"Info","path":"/en/originalnode/14049"},{"label":"Press","path":"/en/university/info/press"},{"label":"Who we are","path":"/en/university/info/press/about"},{"label":"Institutional Communication Service","path":null}],"blocks":[{"t":"html","html":"<p><strong>The Service is responsible for the institutional communication of Università della Svizzera italiana and complies with the University’s communication goals. The numerous activities in the field of education, research, innovation, and cultural and scientific promotion are presented to journalists and the general public, with the contribution of the different components of the University. Moreover, the Service supervises the development of the corporate identity and implements the institutional graphic design</strong>.</p> <p><strong>Activities</strong>:</p> <ul> <li>Disclose USI news and current events to the public and within the University</li> <li>Develop web and social media presence</li> <li>Act as liaison between the press and members of the academic community upon request by the media</li> <li>Coordinate public events</li> <li>Develop corporate identity</li> <li>Implement the institutional graphic design</li> <li>Manage USI visual work</li> <li>Coordinate institutional publications</li> </ul> <p><strong>Contacts</strong></p> <p><strong>Institutional communication</strong><br> Institutional Communication Service<br> Università della Svizzera italiana<br> West Campus Lugano, Main Building, office 212 (Level 2)<br> Via Buffi 13<br> 6900 Lugano, Switzerland <br> tel +41 58 666 4792<br> e-mail <a href=\"mailto:press@usi.ch\">press@usi.ch</a></p> <p><strong>Corporate identity </strong><br> West Campus Lugano, Main Building, office 212 (Level 2)<br> tel +41 58 666 4761 <br> e-mail <a href=\"mailto:corporate-design@usi.ch\">corporate-design@usi.ch</a></p> <p><strong>Graphic design</strong><br> West Campus Lugano, Main Building, office 212 (Level 2)<br> tel +41 58 666 4456<br> e-mail <a href=\"mailto:grafica@usi.ch\">grafica@usi.ch</a></p> <p><strong>Events</strong><br> West Campus Lugano, Main Building, office 212 (Level 2)<br> tel +41 58 666 4220<br> e-mail <a href=\"mailto:eventi.lu@usi.ch\">eventi.lu@usi.ch</a></p> <p><strong>Team:</strong>​</p>"},{"t":"quote","name":"Dr. Cristina Elia Ott","role":"Head","photo":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/images/press-elia-cristina.jpg","html":"<p><a href=\"https://search.usi.ch/en/people/1fe9acdaa2d594db34b3af621ba8641a/elia-ott-cristina\">Contact</a></p>"},{"t":"quote","name":"Alberto Canepa","role":"Graphic design, Events","photo":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/images/press-canepa-alberto.jpg","html":"<p><a href=\"https://search.usi.ch/en/people/e39c1ca8db984128c7fb92eea3823a75/canepa-alberto\">Contact</a></p>"},{"t":"quote","name":"Robin Creti","role":"Institutional communication","photo":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/images/press-creti-robin.jpg","html":"<p><a href=\"https://search.usi.ch/en/people/a392ef029ea192e4620c9c56358a93d7/creti-robin\">Contact</a></p>"},{"t":"quote","name":"Maria Luisa Giannetta","role":"Events","photo":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/images/press-image-22.jpg","html":"<p><a href=\"https://search.usi.ch/index.php/it/persone/67d357501f7e4d3f2ad9bd9be33dc76c/giannetta-maria-luisa\">Conta</a><a href=\"/search.usi.ch/index.php/it/persone/67d357501f7e4d3f2ad9bd9be33dc76c/giannetta-maria-luisa\">cts</a></p>"},{"t":"quote","name":"Prisca Grassi","role":"Digital","photo":"https://www.usi.ch/","html":"<p><a href=\"https://search.usi.ch/en/people/6bd5049820f23cc9fe7b1f817e5ee2be/grassi-prisca-maria\">Contact</a></p>"},{"t":"quote","name":"Vittoria Lomazzi","role":"Eventi","photo":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/images/press-lomazzi-vittoria.jpg","html":"<p><a href=\"https://search.usi.ch/persone/1f7be89814d5095c7ea98ef9a3b5d55d/lomazzi-vittoria\">Contatti</a></p>"},{"t":"quote","name":"Nicola Martinetti","role":"Redazione","photo":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/images/press-martinetti-nicola.jpg","html":"<p><a href=\"https://search.usi.ch/index.php/it/persone/7bd1f16a24123261c82048937200c96d/martinetti-nicola\">Contatti</a></p>"},{"t":"quote","name":"Alessia Padovan","role":"Graphic design","photo":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/images/press-padovan-alessia.jpg","html":"<p><a href=\"https://search.usi.ch/en/people/0b9ec27769f3a79f0ef5bbb7ff27fb33/padovan-alessia\">Contact</a></p>"},{"t":"quote","name":"Mattia Pera","role":"Graphic design, Events","photo":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/images/press-pera-mattia.jpg","html":"<p><a href=\"https://search.usi.ch/en/people/5ce5f550b7261cc6a8dfda3e142eb58c/pera-mattia\">Contact</a></p>"},{"t":"quote","name":"Sarah Peregalli","role":"Institutional communication","photo":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/images/press-peregalli-sarah.jpg","html":"<p><a href=\"https://search.usi.ch/en/people/8edb678097b772e84a18c7d48a6b3f44/peregalli-sarah\">Contacts</a></p>"},{"t":"quote","name":"Gilda Schertenleib","role":"Corporate identity","photo":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/images/press-schertenleib-gilda.jpg","html":"<p><a href=\"https://search.usi.ch/en/people/c595a1440675b3fe2741b458c189423b/schertenleib-gilda\">Contact</a></p>"},{"t":"quote","name":"Tania Vanetti","role":"Graphic design","photo":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/images/press-vanetti-tania.jpg","html":"<p><a href=\"https://search.usi.ch/en/people/4c04d69f8fa1396264ade03bf00d7da6/vanetti-tania\">Contact</a></p>"},{"t":"quote","name":"Barbara Vogt","role":"Institutional communication","photo":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/images/press-vogt-barbara.jpg","html":"<p><a href=\"https://search.usi.ch/en/people/678d5643a34e734b4c344c19ad7f1717/vogt-barbara\">Contact</a></p>"},{"t":"quote","name":"Accademia di architettura","role":"","photo":"https://www.usi.ch/","html":"<p>Per le attività di comunicazione istituzionale concernenti l'Accademia di architettura, il Servizio si coordina con: </p> <ul> <li>arch. <a href=\"http://search.usi.ch/it/persone/823d5a1e8522f40c457342b1ccc76fac/della-torre-marco\">Marco Della Torre</a>, Coordinatore di Direzione dell'Accademia di architettura </li> <li><a href=\"http://search.usi.ch/it/persone/f08daab07cf9f6e6f5464330ece39ba6/dandrea-diana\">Diana D'Andrea</a>, Segretariato di Direzione dell'Accademia di architettura</li> </ul>"},{"t":"html","html":"<p><strong>Academy of Architecture</strong></p> <p>For all corporate communication activities regarding the Academy of Architecture, the Service works alongside with:</p> <ul> <li>arch. <a href=\"https://search.usi.ch/en/people/823d5a1e8522f40c457342b1ccc76fac/della-torre-marco\">Marco Della Torre</a>, Dean’s Office Coordinator at the Academy of Architecture</li> <li><a href=\"https://search.usi.ch/en/people/f08daab07cf9f6e6f5464330ece39ba6/dandrea-diana\">Diana D'Andrea</a>, Dean’s Office Secretariat at the Academy of Architecture</li> <li><a href=\"https://search.usi.ch/en/people/e39c1ca8db984128c7fb92eea3823a75/canepa-alberto\">Alberto Canepa</a>, Graphics and web at the Academy of Architecture</li> </ul>"}],"ctas":[],"n